{"id":"0a986179bb85417f","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-superfalsehood.md","title":"超假谓词","display":"df-superfalsehood — 超假谓词","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-superfalsehood","aliases":["91-df-superfalsehood","91-df-superfalse"],"display":"df-superfalsehood — 超假谓词","depends_on":["[[91-df-supertruth]]","[[91-df-supervaluation]]","[[91-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-superfalsehood"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-superfalsehood</span><span>91-df-superfalse</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-superfalsehood — 超假谓词"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bb495d7446e8fef8\" href=\"?note=bb495d7446e8fef8\" title=\"91-df-supertruth\">91-df-supertruth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3f012d0f8371bf9a\" href=\"?note=3f012d0f8371bf9a\" title=\"91-df-supervaluation\">91-df-supervaluation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-superfalsehood-—-超假谓词-$T^-$\">df-superfalsehood — 超假谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^-\">\\(T^-\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> (对象语言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\to\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\">\\(v:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\to\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}\\)</span> (部分评估)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\ne\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L}(v)\">\\(\\varnothing\\ne\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L}(v)\\)</span> (经典精确化集)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}superfalsehood}\\vdash\nT_v^-\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\mathbb N\\mid\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\land\n\\forall w\\in\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L}(v)\\;w(\\varphi)=\\mathbf f\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}superfalsehood}\\vdash\nT_v^-\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\mathbb N\\mid\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\land\n\\forall w\\in\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L}(v)\\;w(\\varphi)=\\mathbf f\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_v^-\">\\(T_v^-\\)</span>：在所有允许精确化中都为假的句子编码集</li>\n</ul>\n<p>超假谓词的含义：\n超假谓词收集在所有允许精确化中均为假的句子编码。它与超真集合互斥，但在存在间隙时二者通常不是全集中的互补集。</p>\n<p>超真理与超假的关系：\n在超赋值语义中：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_v^+\">\\(T_v^+\\)</span> 收集所有精确化中都真的句子；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_v^-\">\\(T_v^-\\)</span> 收集所有精确化中都假的句子；</li>\n<li>其余句子在不同精确化中取值不同。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三者满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_v^+\\cap T_v^-=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_v^+\\cap T_v^-=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>超假与否定：\n当每个允许精确化都是服从经典否定子句的二值评估时：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in T_v^-\n\\leftrightarrow\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in T_v^+,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in T_v^-\n\\leftrightarrow\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in T_v^+,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in T_v^+\n\\leftrightarrow\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in T_v^-.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in T_v^+\n\\leftrightarrow\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in T_v^-.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这给出超真理与超假在否定下的对称性；它来自精确化的经典组合性，\n不是仅由三值集合本身推出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-superfalsehood-—-超假谓词-$T^-$","text":"df-superfalsehood — 超假谓词 $T^-$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-supertruth","status":"resolved","id":"bb495d7446e8fef8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-supertruth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-supervaluation","status":"resolved","id":"3f012d0f8371bf9a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-supervaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T^-","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"v:\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\to\\{\\mathbf t,\\mathbf f,\\mathbf u\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing\\ne\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L}(v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}superfalsehood}\\vdash\nT_v^-\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in\\mathbb N\\mid\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}\\land\n\\forall w\\in\\operatorname{Prec}_{\\mathcal L}(v)\\;w(\\varphi)=\\mathbf f\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"T_v^-","display":false},{"tex":"T_v^+","display":false},{"tex":"T_v^-","display":false},{"tex":"T_v^+\\cap T_v^-=\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in T_v^-\n\\leftrightarrow\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in T_v^+,","display":true},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in T_v^+\n\\leftrightarrow\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in T_v^-.","display":true}],"bytes":1781,"backlinks":[{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-83","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df-global-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-global-reflection.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-language.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-model.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchical-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories.md]]\n[[91-df-implication-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-induction-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-inner-outer-logic-difference.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-induction.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-internal-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-intrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-iterative-construction.md]]\n[[91-df-jump-operator.md]]